  m_Text: "Use the rollercoaster track to investigate:\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tHow height
    affects speed\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tHow energy transfers between potential and kinetic
    energy\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tHow mass affects energy\n\n\nExperiment with different
    parameters and use the simulation to understand the physics behind rollercoasters."
