  m_Text: The total energy before the coaster moves to a new position is equal to
    the total energy after it reaches that position. If friction is ignored, all
    energy is transferred between gravitational potential energy and kinetic energy.
    When friction is present, some mechanical energy is converted into heat and sound,
    so an additional Energy Lost term must be included.
